# qemu: -acpitable file=@SSDT@ -smbios type=2,manufacturer=HP,product=8A4E
# The default: nothing is written, input is still parsed first, and unload has nothing to restore.
load
write zones FF0000 00FF00 0000FF FFFFFF\n
write backlight 0\n
write zones nonsense\n
write backlight 2\n
info writes_total
read zones
read backlight
unload
kmsg restored the boot colors
kmsg-clean
